OL,3,GNEWSARare tree offspring given lifeline
OL,4,Aat Scottish botanic garden
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe offspring of one of the world's
OL,7,Frarest trees has been given a new home
OL,8,Fin south-west Scotland as
OL,9,Fconservationists step up efforts to
OL,10,Fsave the species from extinction.
OL,12,FTwo seedlings from the last known wild
OL,13,Fdendroseris neriifolia tree have
OL,14,Farrived at Logan Botanic Garden in
OL,15,FDumfries and Galloway after an
OL,16,Finternational rescue effort involving
OL,17,Fexperts in Chile and the UK.
OL,23,APub: 17-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,426,420,260,160,0,100
