OL,2,W//%*// //%Q,.*,%-. * *,$%** %-& (,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSARare tree offspring given lifeline
OL,4,Aat Scottish botanic garden
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe species, native to Robinson Crusoe
OL,7,FIsland in the South Pacific, has been
OL,8,Fpushed to the brink by habitat loss,
OL,9,Finvasive species and repeated
OL,10,Fwildfires.
OL,12,FConservationists hope the move will
OL,13,Fprovide a vital safeguard for the
OL,14,Ffuture of a plant that now survives in
OL,15,Fthe wild as a single tree clinging to a
OL,16,Fcliff face.
OL,23,APub: 17-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
